# C30 remediation after attempt-04 (9/8/8/8/8, fail)

| Finding | Remediation | Where |
|---|---|---|
| R1 late notifications surfaced after their scope retired | The shell store carries the shown scope, set from every snapshot before it renders (`setScope` in the observation callback); `toast(.., tenant)` and `addUnconfirmed` refuse an entry whose tenant/context is not the shown one (a refusal, lost delivery or recheck answered after a switch), `setScope` retires what spoke for the previous scope, and `Toasts` and the unconfirmed strip filter at render as well. Tests: `inbox.test` (Northwind's snooze refused, and lost, only after Meridian is shown: no toast, no Retry strip, nothing back in Northwind's new context); `v2-shell.test` (a late read refusal for a tenant no longer shown is never surfaced; one arriving while shown is) | `store.ts`, `app.tsx`, `toasts.tsx`, `v2-shell.tsx` |
| R2 pending chosen products omitted from coverage | Once anything was attempted for the tenant, every chosen product nothing has reached yet contributes its sources to `sourcesMissing` (state stays `pending`), so Home's line and the completion toast warn until every selected source is established. Tests: `ui_v2_inbox::unread_chosen_products_stay_in_coverage_after_a_partial_attempt` (a standalone overview through the retained Runtime view's `management` read; a fresh tenant's first product-only recheck) | `inbox_domain.rs` |
| R3 needs-role first rechecks reported as never attempted | A missing-role attempt counts as attempted: the read is `done` with the product `needsRole`, every chosen source unread, `lastReadAt` null (nothing established) and the new `ReadStatus.settledAt` carrying the attempt's time; Home announces "Read finished at <settled> · 1 product still needs a role" (warn), the attention list qualifies the all-clear, and the Inbox says the read established nothing. Tests: `ui_v2_inbox::a_first_product_recheck_refused_for_a_role_is_a_settled_attempt`; `inbox.test` settled-attempt rendering | `inbox_domain.rs`, contracts validator (`settledAt`), `home.tsx`, `inbox.tsx`, `copy.ts` |
| Optional: flake descriptions | The packet's limitation names the timing-sensitive suites actually retried (transport connection release, dispatch timeout, Harness turns) instead of Harness turns alone | packet limitation text |

B1/E1 (the C29 live Vulture verification receipt) stay owner-gated (`evidence/C29/live-scope-request.md`).
